Feature: Centres that share a site see nothing of each other
  In order to host several centres on one site
  As the staff or a reader of a centre
  I need to see nothing of another centre's readers, loans or books, by any page or by changing an address

  Background:
    Given two Ayvurenda centres are kept apart

  Scenario: The librarian of a centre works in its library and is turned away from every page of the other
