  Scenario: Changing the address to a reader or a book of the other centre shows nothing of it
    Given I log in as "bibalfa"
    When I open the record "El faro de Alfa" in library "alfa"
    Then I should see "El faro de Alfa"
    When I open the record "La isla de Beta" in library "alfa"
    Then I should see "Not here"
    And the page has nothing of centre "beta"
    When I open the card of reader "lectoralfa" in library "alfa"
    Then I should see "Iker Alfa"
    When I open the card of reader "lectorbeta" in library "alfa"
    Then I should see "Not here"
    And the page has nothing of centre "beta"

